00:57:20.830 --> 00:57:30.290
<v Samantha  Martin>Must bite, must bite, must-- no, no, nice, nice-- bite, must bite, must bite.
<v Samantha  Martin>必须咬，必须咬，必须——不，不，乖，乖——咬，必须咬，必须咬。

00:57:30.290 --> 00:57:36.580
<v Ira  Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira  Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带给大家更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:57:36.580 --> 00:57:41.580
